# Consumers of this package (data-retrieved, data-transformed, ...) install it
# as a git dependency and only ever run the pipeline code. The Polly HTTP
# recordings and snapshots under tests/ are ~1.2GB, which every CI job was
# downloading and unpacking on every run for no reason. Excluding them takes the
# installed package from ~1166MB to ~1MB.
#
# Note: npm uses this file *instead of* .gitignore when packing, so the output
# directories below are repeated from .gitignore to keep them out of the tarball
# when packing from a working tree that has them.
tests/

# output files
transformed-data/
retrieved-data/
combined-data/
matched-data/
cached-data/
cache-llm/
cache/
playwright-failures/

# local tooling
.claude/
.env
*.log
*.tgz
